// Shared `@textures` groups. Field order IS slot order -- `Pass.slot_inputs` is
// indexed by it, and on the sprite lane slot 0 is the unit `stone_draw_mesh`
// binds. A group shared by several programs is also one statement of what that
// sampler is called and where it lands, rather than one per entry point.
//
// A group forks the moment an entry needs a different sampler SET; sharing here
// is only for entries whose set is literally identical.

// The one texture a sprite-format draw binds: `stone_draw_mesh` puts it on unit
// 0, so it must be slot 0 and there must be nothing else in the group. The name
// is now the group's alone -- no Rust site resolves it.
pub struct MainTex {
    uTexture: Sampler2D,
}

// The canvas a copy-shaped pass reads: blit, bloom_blur.
struct InputTex {
    input_tex: Sampler2D,
}

// The canvas a sampling pass reads: the bloom pyramid, nonfinite, present.
pub struct SrcTex {
    src_tex: Sampler2D,
}

// The composited scene a filter pass reads: color_grade, grain, heat_shimmer.
pub struct SceneTex {
    scene_tex: Sampler2D,
}
